**Goal Model – Food‑Delivery Multi‑Robot System**

| Goal ID | Goal Title | Text | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|------------|------|--------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1 | **Food Delivery** | Ensure that a meal is delivered to an inpatient’s room and all ancillary tasks (dish retrieval, door opening) are performed. | `;` | Achieve | – |
| G2 | **Receive Kitchen Order** | Receive the order request from the kitchen system. | `-` | Perform | AND (G1) |
| G3 | **Determine Delivery Method** | Decide whether to deliver the meal onto the patient’s table or onto the robot’s tray. | `-` | Perform | AND (G1) |
| G4 | **Deliver Food** | Execute the delivery of the meal to the room. | `FALLBACK(G4.1, G4.2)` | Perform | AND (G1) |
| G4.1 | **Deliver to Table** | Place the meal onto the patient’s table using the robot’s special manipulation skill. | `-` | Perform | AND (G4) |
| G4.2 | **Deliver to Tray** | Place the meal on the robot’s tray and manage the subsequent retrieval by the patient or a helper. | `-` | Perform | AND (G4) |
| G4.2.1 | **Place on Tray** | Position the meal onto the robot’s tray. | `-` | Perform | AND (G4.2) |
| G4.2.2 | **Indicate Meal** | Announce the meal ID to the patient so they know which one to retrieve. | `-` | Perform | AND (G4.2) |
| G4.2.3 | **Track Retrieval** | Log the time and location of each meal retrieval. | `-` | Perform | AND (G4.2) |
| G4.2.4 | **Alert Wrong Meal** | Notify the patient if an incorrect meal is retrieved. | `-` | Perform | AND (G4.2) |
| G5 | **Retrieve Dishes** | Fetch dirty dishes from the room, using the most suitable cooperation mode. | `FALLBACK(FALLBACK(G5.1, G5.2), G5.3)` | Perform | AND (G1) |
| G5.1 | **Unassisted Retrieval** | Robot fetches dishes alone. | `-` | Perform | AND (G5) |
| G5.2 | **Two‑Robot Cooperation** | Two robots fetch dishes together. | `-` | Perform | AND (G5) |
| G5.3 | **Robot‑Human Cooperation** | Robot fetches dishes with human assistance. | `-` | Perform | AND (G5) |
| G6 | **Manage Door Opening** | Open the room door, using the most suitable cooperation mode. | `FALLBACK(FALLBACK(G6.1, G6.2), G6.3)` | Perform | AND (G1) |
| G6.1 | **Robot Opens Door** | Robot opens the door alone. | `-` | Perform | AND (G6) |
| G6.2 | **Robot‑Human Cooperation** | Robot requests a human to open the door. | `-` | Perform | AND (G6) |
| G6.3 | **Robot‑Robot Cooperation** | Two robots open the door together. | `-` | Perform | AND (G6) |

